---
description: On-page SEO rules for Astro pages
globs: src/pages/**/*.astro
---
- One H1, unique title 25–65 chars, meta description 70–160 (prefer 120–160)
- Self-referencing canonical via BaseLayout (embeds: canonical → full tool URL)
- Primary keyword in title and first paragraph (40–60 word answer-first)
- Visible breadcrumbs + BreadcrumbList; FAQPage JSON-LD whenever a visible FAQ is rendered
- Follow docs/SEO-GUARDRAILS.md and .cursor/rules/seo-guardrails.mdc
